<h3>Exchange Between Thors and Thorfin</h3>

<p>
  Do you want a sword, Thorfin?<br>
  A sword is a tool meant to kill.<br>
  Why do you need it?<br>
  Whose life do you intend to take?<br><br>
  
  > Enemies!<br><br>
  
  Your enemies.<br>
  Who are they?<br><br>
  
  > Well...<br>
  > Bad guys like Halfdan.<br><br>

  Listen to me, my son.<br>
  You don't have enemies.<br>
  The truth is that nobody has them.<br>
  Nobody in this entire world deserves to be hurt.<br><br>

<h3>Thors to Askeladd</h3>

<p>
  The reason i rely on a weapon like this<br>
  is because I'm weak.<br><br>
  A true warrior doesn't need a sword.
</p>

<h3>Exchange Between Thors and Thorkell</h3>

<p>
  <strong>Thors:</strong> Goodbye, Thorkell.<br>
  <strong>Thorkell:</strong> Where is your sword?<br>
  <strong>Thors:</strong> Don't need it.
</p>
